				"readmeComment": "Point and zone cleaning: write `target-point` or `zone-points` first, then send the start action. Zone cleaning (`start-zone-clean`) and map saving are used by the Mi Home app but are not in the published spec. Map editing, saved map selection, room split / merge / rename, schedules and voice pack download need several inputs and are not available. Value mapping `[\"start-sweep\"\u003d\"Start or resume cleaning\",\"pause\"\u003d\"Pause cleaning\",\"stop-sweeping\"\u003d\"Stop cleaning\",\"start-charge\"\u003d\"Return to dock\",\"stop-charge\"\u003d\"Stop returning to dock\",\"start-all-clean\"\u003d\"Start cleaning all rooms\",\"start-all-clean-walls\"\u003d\"Start cleaning all rooms along walls\",\"start-point-clean\"\u003d\"Start point cleaning\",\"pause-point-clean\"\u003d\"Pause point cleaning\",\"start-zone-clean\"\u003d\"Start zone cleaning\",\"find-device\"\u003d\"Locate the robot\",\"reset-side-brush\"\u003d\"Reset side brush life\",\"reset-main-brush\"\u003d\"Reset main brush life\",\"reset-dust-filter\"\u003d\"Reset dust box filter life\",\"reset-map\"\u003d\"Clear the saved map\",\"set-calibration\"\u003d\"Start level calibration\",\"set-new-map\"\u003d\"Create a new map\",\"save-map-to-cloud\"\u003d\"Save the new map\"]`"
			},
